+# TASK-260720-3t8nr3 rework evidence — revision 3
+
+Developer run: `RUN-260730-6a96ec`
+
+## Workspace
+
+- Repository: `/Users/iv/Developer/Wildberries/cocoaskills`
+- Worktree: `.temp/TASK-260720-3t8nr3/worktree`
